    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mewjito Studio</strong> is an indie game development team made up of creators passionate about exploring the intersection of AI and gaming. Our vision is to &quot;Build a living, breathing game universe.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We firmly believe that AI in games shouldn't just be a behind-the-scenes tool \u2014 it has the potential to bring more immersive, lifelike experiences to players. Think of the vivid NPCs in Westworld \u2014 living, breathing characters inside a virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game,\u00a0<strong><i>Circle Mountain Circle Sea,</i></strong>\u00a0is one branch of our journey down this path of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're experimenting with local AI deployment to reduce the cost for players and exploring how AI might inject new possibilities into already well-established gameplay systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're excited about the future of AI and gaming, or just curious about the other directions we're exploring, we warmly invite you to join and follow our community through the channels below. Come brainstorm with us and share your thoughts \u2014 your support is what keeps us going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Farm in <i>Circle Mountain Circle Sea</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/ce8be0ba54b67ed0979ec6a66ea2388c.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/ce8be0ba54b67ed0979ec6a66ea2388c.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/ce8be0ba54b67ed0979ec6a66ea2388c.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chill out and create your own cozy eco-network. Drop in quirky round tiles and turn a patch of empty land into a magical little farm full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Round Tiles, Your Rules!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/19e65a8a39aaa433a665a9a8f8508182.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/19e65a8a39aaa433a665a9a8f8508182.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/19e65a8a39aaa433a665a9a8f8508182.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every tile has its own range and effect. Stack \u2018em, chain \u2018em, mix \u2018n match \u2014 experiment to find the setup that suits your style best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try New Combos, Get More Rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/7d6ef5b132c80f1206166813de7a4108.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/7d6ef5b132c80f1206166813de7a4108.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/7d6ef5b132c80f1206166813de7a4108.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We\u2019ve got 80+ unique eco-tiles ready for you, with plenty more coming soon. Add, swap, and upgrade to fine-tune your farm\u2019s daily output. No two games feel the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your World, Tile by Tile!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/91f4eccc208ce0e6e618925d513d34fe.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=522 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/91f4eccc208ce0e6e618925d513d34fe.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/91f4eccc208ce0e6e618925d513d34fe.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Special terrain tiles can give your farm an extra boost. Want animals to roam a big open \u201cprairie\u201d? Plants to thrive near a \u201criver\u201d? Smart planning makes everything flow better \u2014 literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Tiles, Get Creative!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/14cbd59fe12d9f084ecd7f21d32ba448.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/14cbd59fe12d9f084ecd7f21d32ba448.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You can pit a &quot;Buffalo&quot; against an arcade machine, or have a \u201cBlizzard\u201d belt out a snowstorm song! Our built-in AI lets you customize tiles with fun, unique effects. Go wild and make them truly yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax &amp; Let It Run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/055ecf18a8f32ce3589590a4891c9db0.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=748 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/055ecf18a8f32ce3589590a4891c9db0.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/055ecf18a8f32ce3589590a4891c9db0.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Once you\u2019ve set up your eco-network, kick back and let the game do its thing.<br>Perfect for when you just want to chill \u2014 no stress, no rush, and you can pick it up anytime without losing progress!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Farm in <i>Circle Mountain Circle Sea</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/ce8be0ba54b67ed0979ec6a66ea2388c.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/ce8be0ba54b67ed0979ec6a66ea2388c.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/ce8be0ba54b67ed0979ec6a66ea2388c.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chill out and create your own cozy eco-network. Drop in quirky round tiles and turn a patch of empty land into a magical little farm full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Round Tiles, Your Rules!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/19e65a8a39aaa433a665a9a8f8508182.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/19e65a8a39aaa433a665a9a8f8508182.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/19e65a8a39aaa433a665a9a8f8508182.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every tile has its own range and effect. Stack \u2018em, chain \u2018em, mix \u2018n match \u2014 experiment to find the setup that suits your style best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try New Combos, Get More Rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/7d6ef5b132c80f1206166813de7a4108.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/7d6ef5b132c80f1206166813de7a4108.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/7d6ef5b132c80f1206166813de7a4108.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We\u2019ve got 80+ unique eco-tiles ready for you, with plenty more coming soon. Add, swap, and upgrade to fine-tune your farm\u2019s daily output. No two games feel the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your World, Tile by Tile!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/91f4eccc208ce0e6e618925d513d34fe.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=522 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/91f4eccc208ce0e6e618925d513d34fe.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/91f4eccc208ce0e6e618925d513d34fe.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Special terrain tiles can give your farm an extra boost. Want animals to roam a big open \u201cprairie\u201d? Plants to thrive near a \u201criver\u201d? Smart planning makes everything flow better \u2014 literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Tiles, Get Creative!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/14cbd59fe12d9f084ecd7f21d32ba448.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/14cbd59fe12d9f084ecd7f21d32ba448.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You can pit a &quot;Buffalo&quot; against an arcade machine, or have a \u201cBlizzard\u201d belt out a snowstorm song! Our built-in AI lets you customize tiles with fun, unique effects. Go wild and make them truly yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax &amp; Let It Run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/055ecf18a8f32ce3589590a4891c9db0.poster.avif?t=1752644390\" width=748 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/055ecf18a8f32ce3589590a4891c9db0.webm?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573470/extras/055ecf18a8f32ce3589590a4891c9db0.mp4?t=1752644390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Once you\u2019ve set up your eco-network, kick back and let the game do its thing.<br>Perfect for when you just want to chill \u2014 no stress, no rush, and you can pick it up anytime without losing progress!</p>",
